WEBVTT

00:00:00.643 --> 00:00:05.325
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Three out of four British people do the same thing every weekend!

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.767
After a hard week at work, the weekend is a time to do something fun and exciting.

00:00:13.392 --> 00:00:21.651
But a new study says that 75% of British people do the same activities every Saturday and Sunday.

00:00:22.068 --> 00:00:23.517
What do they do?

00:00:24.027 --> 00:00:32.117
66% watch TV, 46% go shopping, and 48% do housework.

00:00:32.538 --> 00:00:38.533
And 10% spend the weekend at home – they never leave the house!